I have found the ModDownload class. It has a MirrorList property of type string, which is the URL to fetch mirrors from. This matches the usage in DownloadPackageLogic.

I will write a test that creates a ModDownload instance with a MirrorList URL, then creates a DownloadPackageLogic instance with it. The test will verify that the DownloadPackageLogic attempts to fetch the mirror list by calling HttpClient.GetAsync.

Since HttpClient is not mockable here, the test will run the logic and we will verify that no exceptions are thrown and the OnError callback is not called immediately.

I will submit the test now.

